  "solution": {
    "text": "Slop&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>&nbsp;the Given graph<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#981;</mi></msup></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#916;H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.314</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>166</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>28</mn></math></p>",
